       diff pair. Replace that pixel with red in output. Place a blue pixel at a nearby
       empty cell. (Or vice versa -- one becomes left-only=red, one becomes right-only=blue.)
    4. Derive LEFT panel from output: shared pixels keep color, red pixels get the shifted
       color, blue pixels become bg.
    5. Derive RIGHT panel from output: shared pixels keep color, blue pixels get the shifted
       color, red pixels become bg.
    6. Assemble input: left | sep_column | right.
    7. Validate: all fg pixels isolated in both panels, sep color unique, panels equal size.
